{"id":"18afee354a7c01b0","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-homomorphic-image.md","title":"Homomorphic Image Algebra","display":"df-homomorphic-image — Homomorphic Image Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-homomorphic-image","aliases":["93-df-homomorphic-image"],"display":"df-homomorphic-image — Homomorphic Image Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-homomorphic-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-homomorphic-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homomorphic-image — Homomorphic Image Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(-;-,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(-;-,\\tau)\\)</span> are the image-operation and image-algebra constructors defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}\\)</span> are the algebra and subalgebra predicates of the cited dependencies.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathbf B}\\!\\upharpoonright\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathbf B}\\!\\upharpoonright\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{ran}(h),\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{ran}(h),\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau):\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\to\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau))\n\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau),\\mathbf B)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau):\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\to\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau))\n\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau),\\mathbf B)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Homomorphism preservation makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(h)=h[|\\mathbf A|]\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(h)=h[|\\mathbf A|]\\)</span> closed under every basic operation, including nullary operations. Each restricted operation and the indexed operation-family graph are explicit; the source algebra is unnecessary once the typed homomorphism supplies its range.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subalgebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(-;-,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\nf^{\\mathbf B}\\!\\upharpoonright\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle f,\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle:f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle\\operatorname{ran}(h),\n\\operatorname{ImOpFam}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)\n\\right\\rangle","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphic\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\to\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall f\\in\\pi_1(\\tau)\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ImOp}_{93}(f;h,\\mathbf B,\\tau):\n(\\operatorname{ran}(h))^{\\pi_2(\\tau)(f)}\\to\\operatorname{ran}(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau))\n\\land\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau),\\mathbf B)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(h)=h[|\\mathbf A|]","display":false}],"bytes":2196,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1621c792830f597","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)$ is the kernel congruence of [[93-lem-congruence-kernel]], and $\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}(h;\\mathbf B,\\tau)$ is the induced algebra of [[93-df-homomorphic-image]]."},{"id":"ad6be0d5d62b418a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ImAlg}_{93}$ is the image-algebra constructor of [[93-df-homomorphic-image]]."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphic-image]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","f10e7e3251fa7f7d","154cc3ca1a9b40e2"]}